<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GR-0015> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Four subjects in one sentence — a person's name, a descriptive term, a place name, a size or use reference. Recording it as one relationship loses three of them; recording it as four repeats the sentence four times. Which is right is a modelling decision."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/approved> .
