<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GR-0056> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/supportingText> "When faced with this type of reference it is important to remember that the connotation must be from the trade mark itself and not from any other external considerations such as a reputation in another trade mark." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/approved> .
