<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GR-0058> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Note \"s 43\" with a space here, against \"s43\" in TMM/Part29/10#1 and \"section 43\" elsewhere. Three spellings, one provision, one Part."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/approved> .
