<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0005> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "Separating what a mark denotes from what it connotes is a step in reaching the connotation finding, so denotation feeds the answer rather than being one. It is typed relevant_factor on that basis and not on the basis that anybody weighs it."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0005> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/conceptGroup> "relevant_factor" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
