<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0007> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/expertShouldCheck> "This record and GT-0051. GC-0007's own note says the presumption and the mandatory application of s 43 pull in opposite directions; they are typed here as exception and none_of_these respectively, and if that is the wrong pairing both are wrong together."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
