<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0014> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/expertShouldCheck> "Whether an endorsement is a thing that does work or the writing-down of a thing that does. GC-0013's own record note flags this as exactly the kind of tacit distinction the exercise is meant to surface, and it is still open."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
