<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0020> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "The only member of the geographical family the corpus carves out: a place name inside a business identifier is read as saying something about the business, and the ground will rarely apply. That is a case taken out of the rule."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
