<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0022> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/expertShouldCheck> "Whether the vocabulary needs a concept for the compound condition — 'mark connotes an INN and specification is unrestricted' — as distinct from the INN itself. Without one the ground_of_refusal group stays nearly empty."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
