<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0027> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "The corpus states the carve-out directly: the ground will not arise for a long deceased figure even where every other element of the well-known-person branch is present. That is a case taken out of the rule."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
