<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0038> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "A principle about what is looked at when the connotation question is asked, and the corpus says the other features 'diminish the impact' rather than removing the ground. That is weighing, which is what a factor is."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0038> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/conceptGroup> "relevant_factor" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
