<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0040> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringBasis> "corpus_inferred" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0040> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "Opposition is a stage in the process, not a reason to refuse, a question inside the s 43 judgement, or a way out of it. Typed none_of_these as evidence about the taxonomy: the four groups sort the substance of a decision and this concept is about where a decision is made."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
