<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GX-0010> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/caveat> "\"Likely to be viewed as a phoneword\" is itself an evaluative judgement. The inference states the practice conditional on that judgement having been made by a person."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/approved> .
