<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GX-0010> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/expectedConclusion> "Where a mark contains material likely to be viewed as a phoneword, the applicable practice turns on whether the applicant is the owner or authorised user, and the ground is reconsidered on information establishing that they are."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/approved> .
