<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/approvedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name of the person who approved it. A name and a date are the approval artefact, and there is no separate register (ADR-0039)."@en-AU  .
