<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/askedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/askedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/CompetencyQuestion>  .
