<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/certainty> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/certainty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "`explicit` | `default` | `ambiguous`, present on `regex` edges only.\n\n`default` is upstream's inference from a bare 'section 43' — an inference, not a\nstatement by IP Australia. `ambiguous` is upstream refusing to choose between\ninstruments, and it is never resolved here: an ambiguous edge is a reason to put\na passage in front of a person, never a reason to drop it (Q-07)."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/certainty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Citation>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/certainty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "certainty"@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/certainty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/chunkKind> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/chunkKind> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/chunkKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "`body`, `annex` or `landing`. Kept because the corpus is lopsided — 725 of its\n2,460 chunks are annex material — and retrieval that treats every chunk alike\nsurfaces a great deal of it (Q-10)."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/chunkKind> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Chunk>  .
