<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/citesAuthorityFor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ApprovedRelation>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/citesAuthorityFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Approved usage: 1 relationship (GR-0013)."@en-AU  .
