<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/citesCase> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Passage>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/citesCase> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "cites case"@en-AU  .
