<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/citesProvision> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/citesProvision> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Convenience shortcut past the Citation node. Safe for 'which passages mention s 43'; wrong for anything that turns on how the edge was found, which is what tmk:Citation is for."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/citesProvision> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Passage>  .
