<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/conceptGroup> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/conceptGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The group the typing record names, verbatim — including \"none_of_these\".\n\nRedundant with the concept's class for the four groups that have one, and the\nonly record of the fifth. A concept typed none_of_these asserts no class on\npurpose: the four groups do not fit it. Without this property that decision is\nindistinguishable in the graph from a concept nobody has typed at all, and the\ntwo are opposites — one is an answer about the taxonomy, the other is a\ngap (ADR-0093)."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/conceptGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Assertion>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/conceptGroup> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "concept group"@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/confidence> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/confidence> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/confidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A confidence in the **extraction**. Legitimate and required (CLAUDE.md rule 8).\n\nA confidence attached to a legal conclusion is PU-0003 and is prohibited: no\nprobability in this system is calibrated against examination outcomes, and none\ncould be without a decision corpus."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/confidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Assertion>  .
