<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/definitionSource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The passages from which the concept's meaning is drawn.\n\nNote what is NOT asserted alongside it: `skos:definition`. The approved records\ncarry definition *sources* and no definition text, so the graph carries sources\nand no definition text. Writing one would be authoring the vocabulary\n(CLAUDE.md rule 1); the absence is reported by `tmk-ontology-report`."@en-AU  .
