<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/extraction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "`href` — the Manual's authors linked it themselves, the strongest provenance the corpus has. `regex` — upstream read it out of the prose. Upstream's word, never reinterpreted (CLAUDE.md rule 3)."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/extraction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Citation>  .
