<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/impactedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Derived by RULE-0002. This approved record would have to be re-read if that\npassage changed, because the record was read out of it or names it as a\ndefinition source.\n\nRecorded dependency only. A passage that discusses the same subject without\nbeing cited by any record is invisible to it (Q-28), so a nil result means\n'nothing recorded depends on this', never 'nothing is affected'."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/impactedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "impacted by"@en-AU  .
