<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/isStale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The assertion's `tmk:sourceContentHash` no longer matches the pinned snapshot: the passage under it moved. Computed at build time, never asserted by hand."@en-AU  .
