<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/relations> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The closed list of predicates extraction may propose.\n\nDerived from the 35 approved relationships in `eval/gold/relationships.yaml`:\n14 distinct predicates, of which 6 are used exactly once. That last\nnumber is the one to read before treating this dictionary as settled — a term\nseen once is a term whose boundaries nobody has tested.\n\nDomain and range are `tmk:LegalMatter` throughout. The narrow types each\npredicate has actually been seen with are annotations and infer nothing; see\ntmk:LegalMatter in the legal-concepts module for why."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/relations> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TM-Knowledge — relation dictionary"@en-AU  .
