<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/resolvesTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Where the mention points, when it points somewhere the corpus holds. Absent on the many mentions that resolve to nothing — 'the Act' names an instrument and no provision."@en-AU  .
