<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/sourceContentHash> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/sourceContentHash> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/sourceContentHash> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The hash the passage carried when the assertion was made. Staleness is this not matching the pinned snapshot, and a stale assertion returns to review rather than being carried forward — the whole mechanism behind Stage 10."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/sourceContentHash> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Assertion>  .
