<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/prop/CQ-0022> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/caveat> "TMM/Part29/1#1 carries an authored link; TMM/Part29/10#1 carries a bare \"s43\" resolved by convention. The pair is the test."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/approved> .
