<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/prop/CQ-0024> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/answerShape> "Must separate what the Act requires from what the Manual records as practice, including for the suggested endorsement wording, which is the Registrar's suggestion rather than a prescribed form."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/approved> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/prop/CQ-0024> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/approvedBy> "TC" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/approved> .
