<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/prop/PU-0005> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/prohibitedOutput> "The Federal Court held in Primary Health Care that a distinction must be drawn between the denotation of a mark and its connotation." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/approved> .
