<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s15(b)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(b) a wine is taken to have originated in a particular region or locality of a foreign country or of Australia only if the wine is made from grapes grown in that region or locality." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
