<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s15> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "For the purposes of this Act: (a) a wine is taken to have originated in a foreign country or Australia only if the wine is made from grapes grown within the territory of that country or of Australia, as the case may be; and (b) a wine is taken to have originated in a particular region or locality of a foreign country or of Australia only if the wine is made from grapes grown in that region or locality." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
