<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s187(d)~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Note: Division 2 of Part 4 sets out the main grounds for rejecting an application but section 41 does not apply to defensive trade marks (see section 186). Division 2 of Part 5 sets out the main grounds for opposing registration." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s187(d)~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMA1995/s187(d)~1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
