<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s26(2)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(2) If the authorised user brings an action for infringement of the trade mark, the authorised user must make the registered owner of the trade mark a defendant in the action. However, the registered owner is not liable for costs if he or she does not take part in the proceedings." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
