<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s27(1)(b)(ii)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:f86f8e76632173a1eb3ca3c0778af9888a8f74d09bee1c9b4763a85633f50301" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s27(1)(b)(ii)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
