<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s38(2)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMA1995/s38(2)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
