<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s38> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Revocation of acceptance"@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s38> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "law" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s38> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityStatus> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Current> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s38> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s38> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:2bf1242d6c62f0831bf40d6b421afebf993c74e0b40664167ee912e23eefc878" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s38> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) Before a trade mark is registered, the Registrar may revoke the acceptance of the application for registration of the trade mark if he or she is satisfied that: (a) the application should not have been accepted, taking account of all the circumstances that existed when the application was accepted (whether or not the Registrar knew then of their existence); and (b) it is reasonable to revoke the acceptance, taking account of all the circumstances. (2) If the Registrar revokes the acceptance: (a) the application is taken to have never been accepted; and (b) the Registrar must examine, and report on, the application as necessary under section 31; and (c) sections 33 and 34 again apply in relation to the application." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s38> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMA1995/s38" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
