<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s39(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s39(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) An application for the registration of a trade mark must be rejected if the trade mark contains or consists of a sign that, under regulations made for the purposes of section 18, is not to be used as a trade mark." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
