<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s58~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The registration of a trade mark may be opposed on the ground that the applicant is not the owner of the trade mark." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
