<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s65(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) If the particulars of the application have been published under section 30, the application may be amended as provided in this section." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
