<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s65(2)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s65(2)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(2) An amendment may be made to the representation of the trade mark if the amendment does not substantially affect the identity of the trade mark as at the time when the particulars of the application were published." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
