<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s65(5)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(5) An amendment may be made to add to the class or classes of goods or services specified in the application one or more other classes of goods or services if the Registrar is of the opinion that it is fair and reasonable in all the circumstances to do so." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
