<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s84A(1)(a)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMA1995/s84A(1)(a)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
