<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/5/5/1/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "5.1.2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/5/5/1/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 20 Definition of a Trade Mark and Presumption of Registrability" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
