<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/17/17/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "17.1 Trade marks consisting of surnames and a given name" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/17/17/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "22.17. Name of a person" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/17/17/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 22 Section 41 - Capable of Distinguishing" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/17/17/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/17> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/17/17/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/17/17/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part22" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/17/17/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The addition of a given name significantly reduces the likelihood of someone with that surname wishing to use the name in connection with their goods or services. The name of a person will be considered capable of distinguishing unless (1) the name as a whole is common and (2) the goods and services are commonplace. A trade mark consisting of the name JOHN SMITH in relation to clothing would therefore attract a ground for rejection under section 41 whereas most full names would be considered acceptable." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/17/17/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part22/17/17/1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
