<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/17/17/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "17.2 Trade marks consisting of surnames and single common initials" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
