<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part29/2/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "A connotation may result from the whole trade mark or from a part of the trade mark. It may result from a dictionary meaning or from a connection in the minds of the buying public with some person, place or thing." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
