<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part29/5/5/6~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:eadbe3089dae6f38315f32f34c7148d18e1cfe8ba1644e9fc9f5963f47adc92e" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part29/5/5/6~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "29.5. International Non-Proprietary Names (generic names for pharmaceutical substances) and INN stems" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
