<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/2/2/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/chunkKind> "body" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/2/2/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:f1f98ddc44bccf6601ab233800f69bd8b62edc8c27ccb6bbdfb423460ebf1097" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/2/2/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "2.5" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/2/2/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "30.2. Scandalous signs" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/2/2/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 30 Signs that are Scandalous and Use Contrary to Law" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/2/2/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/2/2/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/2/2/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part30" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/2/2/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Consideration should be given to context of use, but that alone cannot be the decisive factor. It is appropriate to consider normal, expected usage rather than possible usage. For example, in relation to an application for t-shirts it would not be appropriate to consider how a trade mark would be received when worn in church during a solemn religious occasion as this would not constitute normal expected usage for such goods." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/2/2/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part30/2/2/5" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/2/2/6> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMM> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
