<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/3/3/5~8> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "3.5 Legislation with particular implications for examination of trade marks" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
