<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part31/4/4/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "4.4 Article 6ter signs - Subreg 4.15(da) and (e)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
