<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/2/1/2-1-2-b-change-in-status> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part32A" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/2/1/2-1-2-b-change-in-status> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "If the PBR status changes from accepted to withdrawn, terminated or expired, the variety no longer has provisional protection and the s 42(b) ground for rejection can be withdrawn." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
