<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/2/1/2-1-2-c-letter-of-consent> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "32A.2.1 Section 42: Contrary to Law" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
