<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/2/1/2/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "2.1.1 Determining if a trade mark is contrary to law on the basis of a PBR variety or synonym" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/2/1/2/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "32A.2.1 Section 42: Contrary to Law" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
