<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/2/1/2/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part32A" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/2/1/2/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Assuming conditions (b) and (c) above apply, there are two considerations to determine (a): Is the PBR variety/synonym present in the trade mark in such a way that it retains its meaning as a variety? If so, then use of the trade mark would infringe the PBR right under s 53(1)(c) of the PBR Act." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
