<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/x-annex-5---case-law-summaries/sfr-holdings-inc-2013-atmo-77-seadwarf~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "32A. Annex 5 - Case Law Summaries" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/x-annex-5---case-law-summaries/sfr-holdings-inc-2013-atmo-77-seadwarf~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 32A Examination of Trade Marks for Plants (in Class 31)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/x-annex-5---case-law-summaries/sfr-holdings-inc-2013-atmo-77-seadwarf~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "SFR Holdings Inc [2013] ATMO 77 (“Seadwarf”)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/x-annex-5---case-law-summaries/sfr-holdings-inc-2013-atmo-77-seadwarf~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/x-annex-5---case-law-summaries> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/x-annex-5---case-law-summaries/sfr-holdings-inc-2013-atmo-77-seadwarf~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/x-annex-5---case-law-summaries/sfr-holdings-inc-2013-atmo-77-seadwarf~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part32A" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/x-annex-5---case-law-summaries/sfr-holdings-inc-2013-atmo-77-seadwarf~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Market place use suggested the intention to establish SEADWARF as an alternate name for SDX-1, rather than as a trade source for the variety. An alternate name is one that should be freely available for others to use. In the context of the research (and the applicant’s submissions during the Hearing process), SEADWARF PASPALUM SDX-1 presents as “alternate name/genus/variety” rather than “trade source/genus/variety”. As such, the primary descriptive meaning of the Trade Mark is that of a particular kind of Paspalum grass." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/x-annex-5---case-law-summaries/sfr-holdings-inc-2013-atmo-77-seadwarf~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part32A/x-annex-5---case-law-summaries/sfr-holdings-inc-2013-atmo-77-seadwarf~2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
