<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/2/overcoming-a-section-43-ground-for-rejection-that-has-been-raised> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "practice" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
