<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part34/5%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Except for section 41, all of Division 2 of Part 4 of the Act and Regulation 4.15 applies to applications for registration of defensive trade marks. All of those provisions operate within the limitation of section 33, which provides a basis for a \"presumption of registrability\"." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
