<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part47/1/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Once the fees and formalities are in order, the notice of intention to oppose will be processed and a copy will be given to the trade mark applicant or IRDA holder." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
