<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part47/1/1/3/1/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "1.3.1 Grounds for requesting an extension" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part47/1/1/3/1/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "1.3.1.2 Circumstances beyond the control of the applicant for extension of time, other than an error or omission by the person, the person’s agent, the Registrar or an employee (regs 5.9(4)(b) and 17A.34C(4)(b))." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
