<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part47/1/1/3/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Where an extension of time is granted, it must be for a period of time that the Registrar believes is reasonable in the circumstances (regs 5.10(3), 17A.34D(3))." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
