<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part52/2/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "2.3 Circumstances under which ex parte hearings may occur" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part52/2/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 52 Hearings, Decisions, Reasons and Appeals" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part52/2/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 52.2.What is a hearing?" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part52/2/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part52/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
