<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.32(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:ff22f65308ac8ef5dd6677ce18c633872b5f942c32f6d99488acbbf8be86d96b" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.32(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.32(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) A notice of opposition is taken to be filed when the notice of intention to oppose and the statement of grounds and particulars have been filed under regulations 17A.33 and 17A.34A." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
