<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.32(2)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(2) The Registrar must notify the International Bureau of the filing of the notice of opposition in accordance with rule 17, as applicable, of the Madrid Regulations." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
