<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.34D(1)> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/LegislativeUnit> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
