<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.34D(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.34D(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) The Registrar may grant a request under subregulation 17A.34C(1) for an extension of time if the Registrar is satisfied that the grounds set out in the request justify the extension." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
