<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.4(2)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(2) The expression ‘all goods’, ‘all services’, ‘all other goods’, or ‘all other services’ must not be used in an application for registration of a trade mark to specify the goods and/or services in respect of which registration is sought." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
