<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.4(7)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(7) If any of the goods and/or services cannot be specified using terms referred to in subregulation (6), the applicant must provide sufficient information to enable the Registrar to decide the classification of the goods and/or services." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
